## Context

The mission (MASTERPLAN) is auditable, reproducible data whose errors are
**locatable** — by others, which requires a persistent, citable deposit, not
a mutable GitHub URL. The manuscript's "Data & Code Availability" pointed only
to github.com/MinhHaDuong/aedist-technical-report. The dissemination tracker
[[0663]] covered paper channels (HAL/release/homepage/CIRED) but had no
code+data DOI child. This ticket closes that gap with a frozen Zenodo snapshot
of the release tag — the interim reproducibility artifact, complementary to the
eventual reconciled-reference **data paper** [[0517]] (which is the citable home
of the reference dataset itself, blocked by 0498).

## What was done

1. `git archive` of tag `economia-2026-report` (commit 2da83d04) → 37.3 MB zip
   (data/, derived/, measurements.jsonl, experiments/outputs/, src/, report/,
   slides/, manuscript sources). Verified no secrets (`.env` gitignored).
2. Zenodo draft deposition 20715180, upload_type=software, CC-BY-4.0, creator
   Ha-Duong ORCID 0000-0001-9988-2100, related ids isSupplementTo HAL
   hal-05658462 + isDerivedFrom the GitHub tag. Reserved DOI
   **10.5281/zenodo.20715180**.
3. Published 2026-06-16 after author review (permanent-DOI gate). Zenodo
   minted **version DOI 10.5281/zenodo.20715180** and **concept DOI (all
   versions) 10.5281/zenodo.20715179**. The next version (preprint snapshot)
   slots in under the same concept DOI via Zenodo "New version".
4. Concept DOI recorded in `~/CNRS/html/src/Ha-Duong.bib` as
   `Ha-Duong2026:AEDISTcode` (mirroring `Ha-Duong2026:CIREDdigitalLogs`),
   with a `data=` relation from the working-paper entry.

## Follow-ups (not this ticket)

- The next manuscript version (v2, with arXiv per [[0665]]) should cite the
  Zenodo DOI in "Data & Code Availability" instead of the bare GitHub URL.
- `CITATION.cff` mislabels the working paper as `preferred-citation: type:
  article` with a placeholder DOI — fix to a non-"article" type (see the
  no-"article"-for-working-paper rule). Separate ticket if not folded in.

## Exit criteria

- [x] Zenodo DOI minted (concept 10.5281/zenodo.20715179, version .20715180)
- [x] DOI recorded in Ha-Duong.bib
- [x] 0663 child list updated
